{'symbol': 'WM', 'date': '2022-08-04 09:20:00', 'title': 'MONDAY DEADLINE NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - AUGUST 4, 2022) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. ("WASTE MANAGEMENT" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: WM) FOR VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES LAWS.'}{'symbol': 'WM', 'date': '2022-08-04 05:45:00', 'title': 'WM LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , AUG. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN WASTE MANAGEMENT, INC. ("WASTE MANAGEMENT" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: WM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF WASTE MANAGEMENT INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD.'}